# A message's picture held by a finger for its menu (sfpages message_files.mbt, @sf.lift_over): it lifts over the
# menu's scrim, up before the menu's sheet, and back down with it as the menu goes. MBUI_FIXTURE=home.
timeout 20000
until 整理发布清单
wait 600
tap 整理发布清单
wait 1000
wheel -900
wait 1800
until img:compare.png
hold 1100 img:compare.png
wait 1600
back
wait 1400
exit
